(A `see` of a .vox file splices that file's statements in before
 compilation - no runtime involvement. This also covers the transitive
 case: math_helpers.vox itself includes greeting.vox.

 Nothing covered includes before, which is how the gate went stale: it
 tested for a ".en" extension while the whole tree uses ".vox", so every
 include silently did not inline and the author got "Unknown function".)

see "./include/math_helpers.vox".

print "double" of 21.
print "greet" of "world".
